      "content": "exactly. it's like a math problem that has no solution. people keep telling me to \"budget better\" or \"find a side hustle\" like that’s going to change the fact that the cost of living is just higher than what a human can actually earn. it feels like i'm just being consumed by a system that doesn't care if i live or die as long as the checks clear. sometimes i just sit there and think... if the equation is truly impossible, why am i even bothering to keep playing the game?",
